@startuml ad-02-active-order-cards
!include ../_style.iuml
title AD-02 · Active-order cards on the home page (UC-04, BR-19)

|Web app (View)|
start
:Read "cupcake.orders" from localStorage\n(up to 5 codes, newest first);
if (Any stored order?) then (no)
  :Show no card;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
while (For each stored code) is (next code)
  :GET /api/orders/{code};
  |API (Controller + Model)|
  :Expire overdue orders (BR-20);
  :Find order by code;
  |Web app (View)|
  if (Response?) then (404)
    :Remove the stored code;
  elseif () then (network error)
    :Keep the code; show no card for it;
  else (200)
    if (pickupStatus = AWAITING_PICKUP?) then (yes)
      :Show card "Seu pedido · code ·\nAguardando retirada";
    else (PICKED_UP or EXPIRED)
      :Remove the stored code;
    endif
  endif
endwhile (done)
note right
  The day the order was placed does not matter.
  Cards exist only in this browser
  (no account, no history list, BR-19).
end note
stop
@enduml
